  "known_local_policies": [
    "Perjury freezes the current hero class at each accepted ordinary other-class Secret discovery; the complete bound pool retains duplicates already active and capacity failures, and the selected result uses ordinary free CAST without hand entry.",
    "Plagiarize uses only the ending opponent actual current-turn physical hand plays, including countered plays and repeated physical plays, in ledger order; generated CASTs, summons, powers, trade and forge are absent.",
    "Copy printed original submitted identities; existing minion intrinsic recipes retain their composition and intrinsic data. Do not preserve local discounts, buffs or later face/control/zone changes. Non-minions use their committed FrozenPlayedFaceFact with ordinary copy provenance and overflow.",
    "An empty relevant turn does not reveal Plagiarize, consistent with historical player reports. Full hand uses existing SecretHandSpace; full-hand exact CN behavior, reveal-reaction ordering and special intrinsic non-minion material remain explicit uncalibrated local boundaries."
  ],
